        <mxCell id="title973" value="ERD &amp;mdash; Sistem Informasi SMK Muhammadiyah 8 Medan (SMK Mapan)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="34" width="2760" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub974" value="PostgreSQL (Supabase) &amp;bull; 29 tabel domain &amp;bull; 39 foreign key &amp;bull; diturunkan dari information_schema produksi, cocok dengan migrasi Laravel" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="70" width="2760" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend975" value="&lt;b&gt;LEGENDA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK = primary key &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; FK = foreign key &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; UQ = unique &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; ? = nullable (boleh NULL)&lt;br&gt;Garis tegas = foreign key asli di database. Garis putus-putus = relasi logis tanpa constraint (polimorfik Sanctum).&lt;br&gt;Kardinalitas: ERone = tepat satu, ERmany = satu-atau-banyak, ERzeroToMany = nol-atau-banyak (FK nullable), ERzeroToOne = nol-atau-satu.&lt;br&gt;Sisi anak memakai notasi &quot;banyak&quot;; sisi induk selalu &quot;satu&quot;. FK ber-UNIQUE tunggal (teachers.user_id, students.user_id, exam_codes.exam_id) digambar 1:1.&lt;br&gt;Dikecualikan (infrastruktur Laravel, bukan domain): cache, cache_locks, jobs, job_batches, failed_jobs, migrations, sessions, password_reset_tokens.&lt;br&gt;Constraint khusus PostgreSQL: user_sessions_active_unique (partial unique, satu sesi aktif per user) dan attempts_active_unique (satu attempt berstatus berjalan per exam+student)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=10;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="2430" width="2760" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
